  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancement of Maternal Health and Paediatric Service</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project comprises the following elements: - Rehabilitation of Mnazi Mmoja referral hospital: This includes the extension and upgrading of the hospital&#x2019;s maternity, paediatric, outpatient and emergency care departments. Upgrading of 15 Primary Healthcare Units (PHCU&#x2019;s): This includes the infrastructural improvements and hands-on equipment (stethoscopes, microscopes, lab test sets, delivery chairs, etc.) of 15 rural health posts, 8 in Unguja and 7 in Pemba, intended to improve antenatal and neonatal care delivery in the rural areas of Zanzibar.</narrative>
  </description>
